// A CLF (SWP master) with a UICC on SWP interface 0 and a second interface for an embedded SE.
// SWP itself is a single wire, point to point: nothing on it is addressed. The registration index is
// Renode plumbing that selects which SWP interface of this CLF a target hangs off.
// The CLF has no register map, so it takes no sysbus address; it is still sysbus.swp to the monitor.
swp: SWP.SimpleSWPController @ sysbus

uicc: Mocks.DummySWPTarget @ swp 0

ese: Mocks.DummySWPTarget @ swp 1
